<title>CHINA: CASIL Telecom IPO 71 times subscribed.</title>
<headline>CASIL Telecom IPO 71 times subscribed.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>CASIL Telecommunications Holdings Ltd said on Monday its initial public offer of 150 million shares at HK$1.18 per share was 71 times subscribed.</p>
<p>Net proceeds, at some HK$148 million, would be used to enhance, further research and develop its existing and new products, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Dealing in its shares will start on August 11 in Hong Kong, it said.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 28436441</p>
</text>
